hadiths[56]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1399","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne Aadam ko paida kya jabke unki lambai saaath haath thi. Phir farmaya: Jao aur un farishton mein se unhey salaam karo. Aur suno ke wo tumhey kya tohfa detey hain. Tumhaara tohfa aur tumhaari aulaad ka tohfa. To unhon-ne kaha: Assalaamu Alaikum! To unhon-ne kaha: Assalaamu Alaika wa Rehmatullah! To unhon-ne badhaa diya: Wa Rehmatullah! To jo Jannat mein daakhil hoga wo Aadam ki soorat par hoga. To makhlooq kam hoti rahi yahan tak ke ab tak. (Bukhari: 3326)"
"1400","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah bin Salaam ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Madina aamad pahunchi. To wo Aap key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main tum se teen key baarey mein poochhne wala hun jinhey Nabi key siwa koi nahi jaanta. Unhon-ne kaha: Qiyaamat ki nishaaniyon mein pehli kya hai? Aur Jannat walon ka pehla khaana jo wo khaengey kya hai? Aur kis cheez se beta apne waalid ki taraf jaata hai aur kis cheez se wo apne khaaluon ki taraf jaata hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey unkey baarey mein abhi Jibreel ne khabar di hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Abdullah ne kaha: Wo farishton mein Yahood ka dushman hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin Qiyaamat ki nishaaniyon mein pehli aag hai jo logon ko mashriq se maghrib ki taraf haankeygi. Aur Jannat walon ka pehla khaana jo wo khaengey machhli key kaleijay ka izaafi tukda hai. Aur betey mein mushabehat: Beshak aadmi jab aurat se milta hai aur uska paani us par sabqat ley jaata hai to mushabehat uskey liye hoti hai. Aur jab uska paani sabqat ley jaata hai to mushabehat uskey liye hoti hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke tum Allah key Rasool ho. Phir unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Yahood jhoothey ilzaam lagaaney wali qaum hain. Agar wo merey Musalman honay se pehley jaan lengey jab tum un se poochhoge to wo tumharey paas mujh par ilzaam lagaaengey. To Yahood aey aur Abdullah ghar mein daakhil huey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein Abdullah bin Salaam kaisa aadmi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein sab se zyada jaan-ney wala aur hamarey sab se zyada jaan-ney waley ka beta. Aur ham mein sab se behtar aur hamarey sab se behtar ka beta. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Batao agar Abdullah Musalman ho jaey? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah use us se panaah dey! To Abdullah unki taraf nikley aur unhon-ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Hamara bura aur hamarey burey ka beta! Aur us par toot padey. (Bukhari: 3329)"
"1401","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar Bani Israel na hotey to gosht na sadta. Aur agar Hawwa na hoten to aurat apne shohar se khayaanat na karti. (Bukhari: 3330)"
"1402","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se marfooan riwayat hai: Beshak Allah aag walon mein sab se halkay azaab waley se kehta hai: Agar tumharey paas zameen mein jo kuchh hai hota to kya tum uskey sath fidya detey? Wo kahega: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To main ne tum se us se halkay ka mutaaliba kya tha jab tum Aadam ki peeth mein they: Ke merey sath shirk na karo. To tum ne shirk key siwa inkaar kya. (Bukhari: 3334)"
"1403","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi jaan zulm se qatl nahi ki jaati magar Aadam key pehley betey par uskey khoon mein se hissa hota hai. Kyunke wo pehla hai jis ne qatl ki bunyaad rakhi. (Bukhari: 3335). Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Roohein jama kiye huey lashkar hain. Phir jo un mein aik doosrey ko pehchaantey hain wo mil jaatey hain. Aur jo un mein aik doosrey se anjaan hain wo ikhtelaaf kartey hain. Aur Yahya bin Ayyub ne kaha, mujh se Yahya bin Saeed ne iskey sath bayan kya. (3336). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1404","[AI-translation] Zainab bint Jahsh (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas ghabraaye huey daakhil huey aur farma rahey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi! Arab key liye buraai se kharaabi hai jo qareeb aa gai hai. Aaj Yajooj aur Majooj ki deewar mein is jaisa khola gaya hai. Aur Aap ne apne angoothey aur us se milne wali (ungli) se halqa banaaya. Zainab bint Jahsh ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham halaak honge jabke ham mein nek log hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, jab gandagi bahut ho jaey. (Bukhari: 3346)"
"1405","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmaata hai: Ae Aadam! To wo kahega: Haaazir hun aur khushnaseeb hun! Aur bhalai terey haathon mein hai. To wo farmaaeyga: Aag key bhejey huey ko nikaalo. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur aag ka bheja hua kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Har hazaar mein se nau sau ninyanbe. To us waqt chhota budha ho jaaeyga (Aur har haamla wali apna hamal rakh degi aur tum logon ko nashey mein dekhogey jabke wo nashey mein na hongey lekin Allah ka azaab sakht hai). Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur ham mein wo aik kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Khushkhabri paao! Beshak tum mein aik aadmi hai. Aur Yajooj aur Majooj mein hazaar hain. Phir farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak mujhey ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka chauthaai hoge. To ham ne takbeer kahi. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka tihaai hoge. To ham ne takbeer kahi. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka aadha hoge. To ham ne takbeer kahi. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum logon mein kaaley baal jaisey nahi ho safed bail ki khaal mein. Ya safed baal jaisey kaaley bail ki khaal mein. (Bukhari: 3348)"
"1406","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Saeed Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ne teen jhooth key siwa jhoot nahi kaha: Un mein se do Allah Zaat key baarey mein: Unka qaul (Beshak main beemaar hun) aur unka qaul (Balke use unkey badey ne kya hai). Aur farmaya: Jabke wo aik din they aur Saara jab wo jabbaaron mein se jabbaar key paas se guzrey. To us se kaha gaya: Beshak yahaan aadmi hai jiskay sath aurat hai jo logon mein sab se haseen hai. To us ne uski taraf bheja aur us se uskey baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Meri behan. To wo Saara key paas aaya. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 3358)"
"1407","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Auraton ne kamarband pehli martaba Ismail ki waalida se liya. Unhon-ne kamarband liya taake Saara par apna nishaan mitaaen. Phir Ibrahim unhey aur unkey betey Ismail ko ley kar aey jabke wo use doodh pilaatin thein yahan tak ke unhey Bait key paas, Zamzam key upar keekar key darkht key paas, masjid key baalaai hissey mein rakkha. Aur Makkah mein us din koi na tha aur us mein paani na tha. To unhey wahaan rakkha. Aur unkey paas thaili rakkhi jis mein khajoor thein aur mashkeeza jis mein paani tha. Phir Ibrahim peeth mor kar chal diye. To Ismail ki waalida unkey peechey aaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae Ibrahim! Tum kahaan jaatey ho aur hamein is waadi mein chhorey jaatey ho jis mein insaan nahi hai aur na kuchh hai. To unhon-ne us se wo baar baar kaha jabke wo unki taraf tawajjeh na kartey they. To unhon-ne us se kaha: Kya Allah ne tumhey iska hukm diya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir wo hamein zaaya na karega. Phir wo wapas aaein. To Ibrahim chaley yahan tak ke jab wo ghaati par they jahaan wo unhey nahi dekhtey they to apne chehrey se Bait ki taraf mutawajjeh huey, phir in kalimat key sath dua ki aur apney haath uthaaey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! (Beshak main ne apni aulaad mein se waadi mein basaaya hai jo kheti wali nahi hai, terey hurmat waley ghar key paas) yahan tak ke (wo shukr karein) tak. Aur Ismail ki waalida Ismail ko doodh pilaatin rahi aur us paani mein se peeten rahin. Yahan tak ke jab mashkeezay mein jo tha khatm ho gaya to wo pyaasi huin aur unka beta pyaasa hua. Aur wo usey tadapta hua dekhney lagein, ya farmaya: Zameen par lot-ta hua. To wo chalein isliye ke wo usey dekhein nahi. To unhon-ne Safa ko zameen mein apne qareeb tareen pahaad paaya aur us par khadi huin. Phir waadi ki taraf munh kar key dekha ke kya wo kisi ko dekhteen hain. To unhon-ne kisi ko na dekha. To Safa se utrein yahan tak ke jab waadi tak pahunchein to apni qameez ka kinara uthaaya, phir mehnat karney waley insaan ki tarah daudin yahan tak ke waadi se guzar gaein. Phir Marwa key paas aaein aur us par khadi huin. Aur dekha ke kya wo kisi ko dekhteen hain. To unhon-ne kisi ko na dekha. To unhon-ne wo saat martaba kya. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To wo logon ki sayi hai un donon key darmiyaan. Phir jab wo Marwa par zaahir huin to aawaaz suni. To unhon-ne kaha: Khamosh! Apne aap ka iraada karti thein. Phir tawajjeh se suna aur phir suni. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne suna diya hai agar tumharey paas madad hai. Phir wo Zamzam ki jagah farishtay key paas thein. To us ne apni edi se, ya farmaya: Apne par se, khoda yahan tak ke paani zaahir hua. To wo use bartan banaane lagein aur apne haath se aisa kehti thein. Aur wo mashkeezay mein paani bharney lagein jabke wo bharney key baad ubalta tha. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ismail ki waalida par rehem farmaaey! Kaash unhon-ne Zamzam ko chhorey rakha hota, ya farmaya: Kaash wo paani mein se na bharten, to Zamzam behta hua chashma hota. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne piya aur apne betey ko doodh pilaaya. To farishtay ne un se kaha: Zaaya honay se na daro. Beshak yahaan Allah ka ghar hai. Ye ladka aur uska baap banaaengey. Aur beshak Allah apne ghar walon ko zaaya nahi karta. Aur ghar zameen se uncha teelay jaisa tha, sailaab aatey aur uskey daaen aur baaen ley jaatey. To wo aise rahin yahan tak ke unkey paas Jurhum mein se qaafila, ya Jurhum mein se ghar waley, Kada key raastey se aatey huey guzrey. To wo Makkah key neechey utrey. To unhon-ne parindey ko chakkar lagaata hua dekha. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ye parinda paani par ghoomta hai. Hamaara is waadi se ahd hai jabke us mein paani nahi hai. To unhon-ne daudney wala ya do daudney waley bhejey. Phir wo paani key paas they. To wo wapas aey aur unhey paani ki khabar di. To wo aey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Ismail ki waalida paani key paas thein. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum hamein ijazat detin ho ke ham tumharey paas utrein? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Lekin tumhaara paani mein haq nahi hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To Ismail ki waalida ko wo paaya jabke wo uns chaahteen thein. To wo utrey. Aur unhon-ne apne ghar walon ki taraf bheja aur wo unkey sath utrey. Yahan tak ke jab un mein se ghar waley they aur ladka jawaan hua aur un se Arbi seekhi. Aur unhey nafees aur pasand aaya jab jawaan hua. Phir jab wo baligh hua to unhon-ne un mein se aurat se uska nikaah kar diya. Aur Ismail ki waalida faut huin. To Ismail key nikaah karney key baad Ibrahim apni chhori hui (aulad) ko dekhney aey. To unhon-ne Ismail ko na paaya. To unhon-ne uski biwi se uskey baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Wo hamaarey liye talaash karney nikla hai. Phir us se unkey guzaarey aur unki haalat key baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Ham buraai mein hain. Ham tangi aur sakhti mein hain. To us ne us se shikaayat ki. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab tumhaara shohar aaey to use salaam kehna aur us se kehna ke wo apne darwaazey ki chaukhat badal dey. Phir jab Ismail aey to goya unhon-ne kuchh mehsoos kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tumharey paas koi aaya tha? Us ne kaha: Haan. Hamaarey paas aisa aisa budha aaya tha. To us ne mujh se tumharey baarey mein poochha aur main ne use khabar di. Aur us ne mujh se poochha ke hamaara guzaara kaisa hai aur main ne use khabar di ke ham mehnat aur sakhti mein hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To kya us ne tumhey kisi cheez ki wasiyat ki? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne mujhey hukm diya ke main tum par salaam padhun. Aur wo kehta hai ke apne darwaazey ki chaukhat badal do. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo merey waalid hain. Aur unhon-ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke main tumhey juda karun. Apne ghar walon se jaa milo. To us ne use talaaq di aur un mein se doosri se nikaah kya. To Ibrahim un se jo Allah ne chaaha thehrey, phir unkey paas baad mein aey. To unhey na paaya. To uski biwi key paas daakhil huey aur us se uskey baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Wo hamaarey liye talaash karney nikla hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum kaisey ho? Aur us se unkey guzaarey aur unki haalat key baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Ham bhalai aur kushaadgi mein hain. Aur Allah ki sana ki. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhaara khaana kya hai? Us ne kaha: Gosht. Unhon-ne kaha: To tumhaara peena kya hai? Us ne kaha: Paani. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Unhey gosht aur paani mein barkat dey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur unkey paas us din daana na tha. Aur agar unkey paas hota to unkey liye us mein dua kartey. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo donon Makkah key siwa kisi par khaali nahi aatey magar wo unhey mawafiq na aatey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab tumhaara shohar aaey to use salaam kehna aur use hukm dena ke wo apne darwaazey ki chaukhat saabit rakkhey. Phir jab Ismail aey to unhon-ne kaha: Kya tumharey paas koi aaya tha? Us ne kaha: Haan. Hamaarey paas achhi soorat wala budha aaya tha. Aur uski tareef ki. To us ne mujh se tumharey baarey mein poochha aur main ne use khabar di. To us ne mujh se poochha ke hamaara guzaara kaisa hai aur main ne use khabar di ke ham bhalai mein hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne tumhey kisi cheez ki wasiyat ki? Us ne kaha: Haan. Wo tum par salaam kehta hai aur tumhey hukm deta hai ke apne darwaazey ki chaukhat saabit rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo merey waalid hain. Aur tum chaukhat ho. Us ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke main tumhey rakkhun. Phir un se jo Allah ne chaaha thehrey. Phir uskey baad aey jabke Ismail Zamzam key qareeb keekar key darkht key neechey apne teer chheel rahey they. Phir jab us ne use dekha to uski taraf khada hua. To unhon-ne waisa kya jaisa waalid betey key sath karta hai aur beta waalid key sath karta hai. Phir kaha: Ae Ismail! Beshak Allah ne mujhey kaam ka hukm diya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To karo jo tumharey Rab ne tumhey hukm diya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tum meri madad karogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main tumhaari madad karunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke main yahaan ghar banaaun. Aur buland teelay ki taraf ishaara kya jo uskey gird hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To us waqt unhon-ne ghar ki bunyaadein uthaain. To Ismail patthar laatey aur Ibrahim banaatey. Yahan tak ke jab imaarat buland hui to ye patthar ley kar aey aur use uskey liye rakkha. To wo us par khadey huey. Jabke wo bana rahey they aur Ismail unhey patthar pakdaatey jabke wo donon kehtey they: (Ae hamaarey Rab! Ham se qabool farma, beshak tu Sun-ney wala Jaan-ney wala hai). (Bukhari: 3364)"
"1408","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham tum par kaisey durood bhejein? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Muhammad aur unki biwiyon aur unki aulaad par rehmat bhej jaisa tum ne Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji. Aur Muhammad aur unki biwiyon aur unki aulaad par barkat bhej jaisa tum ne Aale Ibrahim par barkat bheji. Beshak tu Taareef wala Buzurg hai. (Bukhari: 3369)"
"1409","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum nangey paon nange badan pehley jaisey jama kiye jaaogey. Phir Aap ne padha: (Jaisa ham ne pehli paidaish shuru ki ham use wapas karengey. Ham par waada hai, beshak ham karney waley hain). Aur Qiyaamat key din sab se pehley jinhey kapda pehnaaya jaaeyga Ibrahim hongey. Aur beshak merey sahaaba mein se log baaen taraf pakdey jaaengey. To main kahunga: Merey sahaaba, merey sahaaba! To wo kahega: Beshak wo tumhaarey juda honay key baad apni ediyon par murtad hotey rahey. To main kahunga jaisa nek bande ne kaha: (Aur main un par gawaah tha jab tak main un mein tha. Phir jab tum ne mujhey faut kya) uskey qaul (Zabardast Hikmat wala) tak. (Bukhari: 3349)"
"1410","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ibrahim apne waalid Aazar se Qiyaamat key din milega jabke Aazar key chehrey par siyaahi aur gubaar hoga. To Ibrahim us se kahega: Kya main ne tum se nahi kaha tha ke meri naafarmaani na karo? To uska waalid kahega: Aaj main tumhaari naafarmaani na karunga. To Ibrahim kahega: Ae merey Rab! Beshak tum ne mujh se waada kya tha ke tum mujhey us din ruswa na karogey jab wo uthaaey jaaengey. To kaunsi ruswai merey door key baap se zyada hai. To Allah Taala farmaaeyga: Beshak main ne Jannat kaafiron par haraam ki hai. Phir kaha jaaeyga: Ae Ibrahim! Tumharey pairon key neechey kya hai? To wo dekhega aur wo gandagi mein lat-pat bijju hoga. To use uski taangon se pakda jaaeyga aur aag mein daal diya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 3350)"
"1411","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon mein sab se izzat wala kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Un mein sab se zyada parhezgaar. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham tum se iskey baarey mein nahi poochhtey. Aap ne farmaya: To Yusuf Allah key Nabi, jo Allah key Nabi key betey, jo Allah key Nabi key betey, jo Allah key Khaleel key betey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham tum se iskey baarey mein nahi poochhtey. Aap ne farmaya: To tum Arab key madanon key baarey mein poochhtey ho? Unkey jaahiliyat mein behtar unkey Islam mein behtar hain jab wo samjhein. (Bukhari: 3353)"
"1412","[AI-translation] Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aaj raat merey paas do aaney waley aey. To ham lambay aadmi key paas aey jiska sar main lambai ki wajah se mushkil se dekh sakta tha. Aur beshak wo Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) hain. (Bukhari: 3354)"
"1413","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin Ibrahim ka to apne saathi ki taraf dekho. Aur Musa ka to ghungryaaley baalon wala gendum rang aadmi jo surkh oont par hai jiski naakel chadi ki hai. Goya main use dekh raha hun jo waadi mein utra. (Bukhari: 3355)"
"1414","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ne khatna karaaya jabke wo assi saal key they. (Bukhari: 3356)"
"1415","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai: Qadoom (aala) key sath. Takhfeef key sath. (Bukhari: 3356)"
"1416","[AI-translation] Aur Umm Shareek (Raziallahu anha) ki hadees guzar chuki hai: Ke Nabi ne chhipkali ko qatl karney ka hukm diya. Aur wo guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan badhaa diya: Wo Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) par phoonkti thi. (Bukhari: 3359)"
"1417","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Auraton ne kamarband pehli martaba Ismail ki waalida se liya. Unhon-ne kamarband liya taake Saara par apna nishaan mitaaen. Phir Ibrahim unhey ley kar aey. Ye lambi Hajar wali hadees hai jo 1407 mein guzar chuki hai, Zamzam key zahoor, Jurhum key aamad, Ismail key do nikaahon aur Bait ki tameer key sath. (Bukhari: 3364)"
"1418","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hasan aur Husain ko panaah detey they aur farmaatey they: Beshak tumhaarey waalid unkey sath Ismail aur Ishaaq ko panaah detey they: Main Allah key poorey kalimat key sath panaah maangta hun har shaitaan aur zehreeley se aur har lagney wali aankh se. (Bukhari: 3371)"
"1419","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham Ibrahim se shak ka zyada haqdaar hain jab unhon-ne kaha: (Ae merey Rab! Mujhey dikha ke tu murdon ko kaisey zinda karta hai. Us ne farmaya: Kya tum imaan nahi laaey? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, lekin taake mera dil mutmaen ho). Aur Allah Loot par rehem farmaaey, wo mazboot saharey ki taraf panaah letey they. Aur agar main qaid mein utna theharta jitna Yusuf thehrey to bul aaney waley ko jawaab deta. (Bukhari: 3372)"
"1420","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aslam mein se giroh key paas se guzrey jo teerandaazi kar rahey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teer chalaao ae Bani Ismail! Beshak tumhaarey waalid teerandaaz they. Teer chalaao jabke main Bani fulaan key sath hun. Unhon-ne kaha: To aik fareeq ne apne haathon se rok liya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hua ke tum teer nahi cha laatey? To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham teer chalaaein jabke tum unkey sath ho? Aap ne farmaya: Teer chalaao jabke main tum sab key sath hun. (Bukhari: 3373)"
"1421","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Tabook key ghazwe mein Hijr mein utrey to unhey hukm diya ke wo uskey kuwein se na piyen aur na us se paani bharein. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne us se goondha hai aur paani bhara hai. To Aap ne unhey hukm diya ke wo wo aata phenk dein aur wo paani baha dein. (Bukhari: 3378). Saalim bin Abdullah se apne waalid se (Raziallahu anhum) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Hijr se guzrey to farmaya: Unkey maskanon mein daakhil na ho jinhon-ne apni jaanon par zulm kya magar ye ke tum rotey huey ho, ke tumhey wo pahunchay jo unhey pahuncha tha. Phir Aap ne apni chaadar se munh dhaanpa jabke Aap sawaari par they. (3380). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1422","[AI-translation] Aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Kareem jo Kareem ka beta jo Kareem ka beta jo Kareem ka beta: Yusuf bin Yaqoob bin Ishaaq bin Ibrahim (Alaihimussalam). (Bukhari: 3382)"
"1423","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Khizr ka naam Khizr isliye rakkha gaya ke wo safed ghaas par baithey aur wo unkey peechey sabz lehlahaati thi. (Bukhari: 3402)"
"1424","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath peelu tod rahey they. Aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us mein se kaaley lo, beshak wo umda hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum bakriyaan charaatey they? Aap ne farmaya: Aur Nabi kaun hai magar us ne unhey charaaya hai? (Bukhari: 3406). Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadam aur Musa ne hujjat ki. To Musa ne us se kaha: Tum Aadam ho jisey tumhaari khata ne Jannat se nikaala. To Aadam ne us se kaha: Tum Musa ho jise Allah ne apne paighaamon aur apne kalaam key sath muntakhib kya. Phir tum mujhey muamley par malaamat kartey ho jo mujh par meri paidaish se pehley muqaddar kya gaya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To Aadam Musa par ghaalib aey. Do martaba. (3409). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1425","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmiyon mein se bahut kaamil huey. Aur auraton mein Aasiya jo Firaun ki biwi hain aur Maryam bint Imraan key siwa kaamil nahi huin. Aur beshak Aisha ki auraton par fazeelat sareed ki tamaam khaanon par fazeelat jaisi hai. (Bukhari: 3411)"

"1426","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bande key liye munaasib nahi hai ke wo kahey ke main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun. Aur usey uskey waalid ki taraf mansoob kya. (Bukhari: 3413)"
"1427","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Dawood par Quran halka kya gaya tha. To wo apne jaanvaron ko tayyaar karney ka hukm detey aur apne jaanvaron key tayyaar honay se pehley Quran padhtey. Aur apne haath ki kamaai key siwa na khaatey. (Bukhari: 3417)"
"1428","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Meri aur logon ki misaal aisey aadmi jaisi hai jis ne aag jalaai. To patangey aur ye jaanwar aag mein girney lagey. (Bukhari: 3426)"
"1429","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Uski auraton mein behtar Maryam bint Imraan hain. Aur uski auraton mein behtar Khadija hain. (Bukhari: 3432)"
"1430","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Quraish ki auratein unt par sawaar honay wali auraton mein behtar hain. Bachchey par zyada meherbaan aur shohar par apne haath mein zyada nighebaan. (Bukhari: 3434)"
"1431","[AI-translation] Ubaada (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo gawahi dey ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo Akela hai, uska koi shareek nahi. Aur ke Muhammad uska banda aur uska Rasool hai. Aur ke Isa Allah ka banda aur uska Rasool hai aur uska kalimat hai jo us ne Maryam ki taraf daala aur uski taraf se rooh hai. Aur Jannat haq hai aur aag haq hai, to Allah use Jannat mein daakhil karega jo amal tha us par. (Bukhari: 3435)"
"1432","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jhule mein sirf teen ne baat ki: Isa. Aur Bani Israel mein aadmi tha jisey Juraij kaha jaata tha. Wo namaz padhta tha. Uski maan uskey paas aai aur use bulaaya. To us ne kaha: Main usey jawaab dun ya namaz padhun. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Use maut na dey yahan tak ke tu use faahisha auraton key chehrey dikhaaey. Aur Juraij apni khaanqaah mein tha. To uskey paas aurat aai aur us se baat ki aur us ne inkaar kar diya. To wo charwaahay key paas aai aur use apne aap par qaabu diya. To us ne ladka jana. To us ne kaha: Juraij se hai. To wo uskey paas aey aur uski khaanqaah todi aur use utaara aur use bura kaha. To us ne wuzu kya aur namaz padhi, phir ladkey key paas aaya aur kaha: Ae ladkey tumhara baap kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Charwaaha. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham tumhaari khaanqaah sonay se banaaengey. Us ne kaha: Nahi, magar mitti se. Aur aurat thi jo Bani Israel mein se apne betey ko doodh pilaati thi. To uskey paas ghudsawaar aala libaas wala guzra. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko us jaisa bana! To us ne uski chhaati chhori aur sawaar ki taraf aaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey us jaisa na bana! Phir uski chhaati ki taraf aaya aur use choosta raha. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Goya main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apni ungli choostey huey dekh raha hun. Phir londi key paas se guzra gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko is jaisa na bana! To us ne uski chhaati chhori aur kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey us jaisa bana! To us ne kaha: Wo kyun? To us ne kaha: Sawaar jabbaaron mein se jabbaar hai. Aur ye londi, wo kehtey hain: Tum ne chori ki, tum ne zina kya, jabke us ne nahi kya. (Bukhari: 3436)"
"1433","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne Isa aur Musa aur Ibrahim ko dekha. Lekin Isa to surkh ghungryaaley baalon waley chaudey seeney waley. Aur Musa to gendum rang bhari jism waley seedhey baalon waley, goya Zutt key aadmiyon mein se hain. (Bukhari: 3438)"
"1434","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey aaj raat Kaaba key paas khwaab mein dikhaaya gaya. Phir gendum rang aadmi goya aadmiyon key gendum rang mein sab se haseen hai, uski zulfein uskey kandhon key darmiyaan padti thein, ghungryaaley baalon wala, uska sar paani tapkaata tha, jabke wo apney haath do aadmiyon key kandhon par rakkhey huey tha. Aur wo Bait ka tawaaf kar raha tha. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Ye Maseeh bin Maryam hain. Phir main ne uskey peechey aadmi dekha jo ghungryaaley sakht baalon wala, daaen aankh se kaana tha. Sab se zyada mushaabeh jise main ne dekha Ibn Qatan key sath. Jabke wo apney haath aadmi key kandhon par rakkhey huey tha aur Bait ka tawaaf kar raha tha. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Maseeh Dajjaal hai. (Bukhari: 3440)"
"1435","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) aik doosri riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Isa key liye surkh nahi farmaya. Lekin Aap ne farmaya: Jabke main soya hua Kaaba ka tawaaf kar raha tha. Phir gendum rang aadmi seedhey baalon wala. Do aadmiyon key darmiyaan sahara diya hua. Uska sar paani tapkaata tha. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ibn Maryam. To main mur kar dekhney gaya. Phir surkh bhari jism wala aadmi ghungryaaley sar wala, uski daaen aankh se kaana. Goya uski aankh ubhri hui angoor hai. Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Dajjaal hai. Aur logon mein us se zyada mushaabeh Ibn Qatan hai. (Bukhari: 3441)"
"1436","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Main Ibn Maryam ka logon mein sab se zyada haqdaar hun. Aur Nabi aalaati bhai hain. Merey aur uskey darmiyaan Nabi nahi hai. (Bukhari: 3442)"
"1437","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Isa bin Maryam ka duniya aur aakhirat mein logon mein sab se zyada haqdaar hun. Aur Nabi aalaati bhai hain. Unki maaein juda juda hain aur unka deen aik hai. (Bukhari: 3443)"
"1438","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Isa bin Maryam ne aadmi ko chori kartey huey dekha. To us se farmaya: Tum ne chori ki? Us ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, qasam us Allah ki jiskey siwa koi mabood nahi! To Isa ne farmaya: Main Allah par imaan laaya aur apni aankh ko jhutlaaya. (Bukhari: 3444)"
"1439","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo mimbar par kehtey hain: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Meri had se zyada tareef na karo jaisa Nasaara ne Ibn Maryam ki had se zyada tareef ki. Beshak main uska banda hun. To kaho: Allah ka banda aur uska Rasool! (Bukhari: 3445)"
"1440","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hoga jab Ibn Maryam tum mein utrengay jabke tumhaara Imam tum mein se hoga. (Bukhari: 3449)"
"1441","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna jo farmaatey they: Beshak Dajjaal key sath jab wo niklega paani aur aag hogi. Lekin jo log dekhtey hain ke wo aag hai wo thanda paani hai. Aur jo log dekhtey hain ke wo thanda paani hai wo jalaaney wali aag hai. Phir jo tum mein paaey to use us mein padna chaahiye jo wo dekhta hai ke wo aag hai. Beshak wo meetha thanda hai. (Bukhari: 3450)"
"1442","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Huzaifa Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak aadmi ki maut haazir hui. Phir jab wo zindagi se mayoos hua to apne ghar walon ko wasiyat ki: Jab main mar jaaun to merey liye bahut lakdiyaan jama karo aur us mein aag jalaao yahan tak ke jab wo mera gosht khaa jaey aur meri haddi tak pahunchay aur jal jaey to use lo aur pees lo. Phir hawa waley din ko dekho aur use samandar mein bikhair do. To unhon-ne aisa kya. To Allah ne use jama kya aur us se farmaya: Tum ne wo kyun kya? Us ne kaha: Tumharey khauf se. To Allah ne use maaf kar diya. (Bukhari: 3452)"
"1443","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel ki siyaasat Nabi kartey they. Jab Nabi halaak hota to Nabi uska jaanasheen hota. Aur beshak merey baad Nabi nahi hai. Aur khaleefa honge aur bahut honge. Unhon-ne kaha: To tum hamein kya hukm detey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Pehley phir pehley ki baiat poori karo. Unhey unka haq do. Beshak Allah un se uskey baarey mein poochhega jo us ne unhey sonpa tha. (Bukhari: 3455)"
"1444","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum zaroor tum se pehlon key tareeqon par chalogey, baalisht se baalisht aur haath se haath. Yahan tak ke agar wo goh key suraakh mein daakhil huey to tum us mein daakhil hogey. Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Yahood aur Nasaara? Aap ne farmaya: To kaun? (Bukhari: 3456)"
"1445","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri taraf se pahunchao agarchey aayat ho. Aur Bani Israel se bayan karo aur harj nahi hai. Aur jo mujh par jaan boojh kar jhoot boley to use aag mein apna thikaana banaana chaahiye. (Bukhari: 3461)"
"1446","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood aur Nasaara khizaab nahi lagaatey. To unki mukhaalifat karo. (Bukhari: 3462)"
"1447","[AI-translation] Jundub bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehlon mein aadmi tha jise zakhm tha. To wo ghabraaya aur chhuri li aur us se apna haath kaata. To khoon na ruka yahan tak ke wo mara. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Merey bandey ne apni jaan key sath mujh par jaldi ki. Main ne us par Jannat haraam kar di. (Bukhari: 3463)"
"1448","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel mein teen they: Bars wala aur ganja aur andha. Allah ne chaaha ke unhey aazmaaey. To unki taraf farishta bheja. To bars waley key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Tumhey kaunsi cheez sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Achha rang aur achhi jild. Logon ne mujhey ganda samjha hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne use chhua aur us se door ho gaya aur use achha rang aur achhi jild di gai. To us ne kaha: Tumhey kaunsa maal sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Oont. To use haamla oontni di gai. To us ne kaha: Tumhaarey liye us mein barkat di jaey. Aur ganjay key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Tumhey kaunsi cheez sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Achhey baal aur ye mujh se door ho jaey. Logon ne mujhey ganda samjha hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne use chhua aur wo door ho gaya aur use achhey baal diye gaey. Unhon-ne kaha: To tumhey kaunsa maal sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Gaey. Unhon-ne kaha: To use haamla gaey di. Aur kaha: Tumhaarey liye us mein barkat di jaey. Aur andhay key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Tumhey kaunsi cheez sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Allah meri beenaai mujhey wapas kar dey aur main us se logon ko dekhun. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne use chhua aur Allah ne uski beenaai usey wapas kar di. Unhon-ne kaha: To tumhey kaunsa maal sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Bakriyaan. To use bachcha denay wali bakri di. To donon ne bachchey diye aur is ne (nasal badhaai). To iskey liye oonton ki waadi thi. Aur iskey liye gaayon ki waadi thi. Aur iskey liye bakriyon ki waadi thi. Phir wo bars waley key paas uski soorat aur uski halat mein aaya. To us ne kaha: Miskeen aadmi hun, safar mein meri rassiyaan toot gaein. To aaj Allah key siwa phir tumharey sath pohochna nahi hai. Tum se uskey naam par maangta hun jis ne tumhey achha rang aur achhi jild aur maal diya, oont jis par sawaar ho kar safar mein pahunchoon. To us ne us se kaha: Beshak haq bahut hain. To us ne us se kaha: Goya main tumhey pehchaanta hun. Kya tum bars waley na they jisey log ganda samajhtey they, faqueer, aur Allah ne tumhey diya? To us ne kaha: Main ne badey se badey ka waaris paaya hai. To us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoothey ho to Allah tumhey waisa kar dey jaisa tum they. Aur ganjay key paas uski soorat aur uski halat mein aaya. To us se waisa kaha jaisa is se kaha tha. To us ne usey waisa jawaab diya jaisa is ne usey jawaab diya tha. To us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoothey ho to Allah tumhey waisa kar dey jaisa tum they. Aur andhay key paas uski soorat mein aaya. To us ne kaha: Miskeen aadmi aur musaafir hun. Aur safar mein meri rassiyaan toot gaein. To aaj Allah key siwa phir tumharey sath pohochna nahi hai. Tum se uskey naam par maangta hun jis ne tumhaari beenaai tumhey wapas ki, bakri jis se safar mein pahunchoon. To us ne kaha: Main andha tha aur Allah ne meri beenaai wapas kar di. Aur faqueer tha aur us ne mujhey ghani kar diya. To jo chaaaho lo. To Allah ki qasam aaj main tumhey us cheez mein mashaqqat na dunga jo tum ne Allah key liye li. To us ne kaha: Apna maal rok rakkho. Beshak tum aazmaaey gaey ho. Allah tum se raazi hua hai aur tumhaarey donon saathiyon par naaraaz hua hai. (Bukhari: 3464)"
"1449","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein aadmi tha jis ne ninyanbe insaan qatl kiye they. Phir wo poochhney nikla. To wo raahib key paas aaya aur us se poochha. To us ne us se kaha: Kya tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To us ne use qatl kar diya. To wo poochhta raha. To us se aadmi ne kaha: Fulaan fulaan basti mein jao. To use maut ne paa liya. To us ne apne seeney se uski taraf jhuka. To uskey baarey mein Rehmat key farishton aur azaab key farishton ne jhagda kya. To Allah ne iski taraf wahi ki ke qareeb ho. Aur Allah ne iski taraf wahi ki ke door ho. Aur farmaya: Un donon key darmiyaan naapo. To wo iski taraf baalisht qareeb paaya gaya. To use maaf kar diya gaya. (Bukhari: 3470)"
"1450","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ne aadmi se uski jaaedaad khareedi. To wo aadmi jis ne jaaedaad khareedi thi us ne apni jaaedaad mein ghada paaya jis mein sona tha. To wo jis ne jaaedaad khareedi thi us ne us se kaha: Mujh se apna sona lo. Beshak main ne tum se zameen khareedi hai aur main ne tum se sona nahi khareeda hai. Aur jiski zameen thi us ne kaha: Beshak main ne tumhey zameen bechi hai aur jo us mein hai. To wo donon aadmi key paas muqadma ley gaey. To wo jiski taraf muqadma ley gaey they us ne kaha: Kya tumhaari aulaad hai? Un mein se aik ne kaha: Mera ladka hai. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Meri ladki hai. Us ne kaha: Ladkey ka ladki se nikaah kar do. Aur apne aap par us mein se kharch karo aur sadqa karo. (Bukhari: 3472)"
"1451","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se taoon key baarey mein kya suna hai? To Usaama ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taoon gandagi hai jo Bani Israel ke giroh par ya tum se pehlon par bheji gai thi. Phir jab tum usey zameen mein suno to us par aagey na badho. Aur jab wo zameen mein waaqe ho jabke tum us mein ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo. (Bukhari: 3473)"
"1452","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se taoon key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne mujhey khabar di: Ke wo azaab hai jo Allah jise chaahta hai bhejta hai. Aur beshak Allah ne use mominon key liye rehmat banaaya hai. Jo koi ho jis par taoon waaqe ho aur wo apne shehar mein sabr aur sawaab ki ummeed mein thehrey, jaanta ho ke use sirf wo pahunchega jo Allah ne uskey liye likha hai, magar uskey liye shaheed key ajr jaisa hoga. (Bukhari: 3474)"
"1453","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Goya main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun jo Nabiyon mein se Nabi ki hikayat kartey hain jise uski qaum ne maara aur khooni kar diya jabke wo apne chehrey se khoon ponchhtey hain aur farmaatey hain: Ae Allah! Meri qaum ko maaf farma, beshak wo nahi jaantey. (Bukhari: 3477)"
"1454","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke aadmi takabbur se apna tehband ghaseet raha tha to use dhansa diya gaya. To wo Qiyaamat key din tak zameen mein dhasta rahega. (Bukhari: 3485). Manaaqib ki kitaab."
